menu "sys_project"

    config SYS_PROJECT_MAX_BYTES
        int "Largest project stream (bytes)"
        default 65536
        range 1024 262144
        help
          Largest stream a project save accepts (all sections, with their u16
          frame lengths). The stream is stored twice while a save runs (the
          new bank next to the stored one), so keep twice this below the
          project partition (partitions.csv, 512 KB shared with the actions).

    config SYS_PROJECT_MAX_SECTIONS
        int "Sections with their own ID"
        default 40
        range 1 255
        help
          Settings, device and user records one project may carry next to its
          program (the log and power settings are 5, every device one).

    config SYS_PROJECT_MAX_CHUNKS
        int "Program chunks"
        default 32
        range 1 255
        help
          The program is cut into records of CONFIG_SYS_ACTIONS_MAX_BYTES at
          the most (whole frames only); this many of them. Together with the
          record size it bounds the program (32 x 4 KB = 128 KB).

endmenu
